<p>Group ownership: <b>Ashok Leyland</b> is Hinduja; <b>Hindalco</b> is Aditya Birla; Suzlon is not Punj Lloyd. <b>Roche</b> (Basel) is pharmaceuticals and diagnostics, not financial services, whereas <b>JP Morgan Chase</b> is financial services and <b>WL Ross</b> and <b>Warburg Pincus</b> are private equity firms. <b>Chevron</b> is a US oil and gas major, not a pharma company like Pfizer, Nicholas Piramal or Zydus Cadila. <b>BMW and Daimler</b> are German, <b>Volkswagen</b> German and <b>Renault</b> French.</p>

